  "title": "Thai Sweet Sticky Rice With Mango (Khao Neeo Mamuang)",
  "description": "Mango sticky rice is a classic Thai dessert that’s easy to make at home with sticky white rice, a sweet coconut sauce, and slices of fresh ripe mango.",
