  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups water",
    "1.5 cups uncooked short-grain white rice",
    "1.5 cups coconut milk, divided",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt, divided",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon tapioca starch",
    "3 mangos, peeled and sliced",
    "1 tablespoon toasted sesame seeds"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2s9hZxkXGAs3c6O72cquhguG6cM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-7ad094b3d42342d8ad88dffb4076c050.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water and rice in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, cover, and reduce heat to low. Simmer until water is absorbed, 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HiOoEZV1Ja9_bIuLW-ltDVkbOfc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-056a32bc66cb46ac8d360848cdc231eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the rice is cooking, combine 1 ½ cups coconut milk, 1 cup sugar, and 1/2 teaspoon salt in another saucepan. Bring to a boil over medium heat; remove from the heat and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/66gQ4SkZ_9ZzcTc3-UrVCOIyVyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-49f26cb49e5d4503b3ad44e23e6c8113.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cooked rice into coconut milk mixture. Cover and allow to cool for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Gpvjdhk2mjyVmh9SnVoz_bfQAtw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-061475234aae4faf95fa1720e4e260e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a sauce by combining 1/2 cup coconut milk, 1 tablespoon sugar, 1/4 teaspoon salt, and tapioca starch in another saucepan; bring to a boil. Cook and stir just until thickened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mTPlFsgINUukeZtt-Lq78r0RUpc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-c0a93f80b8d04659a77d4771998c7c1e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place coconut rice on a serving dish and arrange mangos on top. Pour sauce over mangos and rice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UundAs7ZbpGNkvinEjZEuAxtdcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-150313-thai-sweet-sticky-rice-with-mango-khao-neeo-mamuang-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-d6b127744d0546ed97ea88573a7fae27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150313/step_06.webp"
    },
